<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $164 mln in repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $164 mln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Thursday it placed $164 million in overnight repurchase agreements at nine percent against government bonds.</p>
<p>In the interbank market, overnight call money rose to 7.50 percent from 6.95 percent Wednesday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar fell to 0.99977 pesos from 0.99983 pesos at the close Wednesday.</p>
</text>
